Let's add a keydown check: In input handler, if ev.key === ' ' then applyThrust().

Currently input handler attaches keydown listener: if (ev.key === 'r' ...) reset; keys.add(ev.key). So we can add before keys.add? If we want to handle thrust we can modify to:

